                      <li>Ship product surfaces end to end, from spec to release.</li>
                      <li class="jd-hit">Own our design system and component library.</li>
                      <li>Keep the app fast — performance is a feature here.</li>
                    </ul>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <!-- 2. The capture card, whose three fields fill in sequence
                     rather than all at once: filling one at a time is the only
                     way a reader can tell it is reading the page rather than
                     showing a form. -->
                <div class="act-panel act-ext">
                  <div class="ext-head">
                    <span class="ext-mark">j</span>
